@startuml task_reaction_snapshot
!pragma layout smetana
title 标式化投影任务: reaction_snapshot
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false

database "事件 outbox 关于反应的事实" as OUTBOX
participant "任务投影器" as PROJECTOR
database "类型任务" as TASKS
database "Scope message\nlease + fencing" as CLAIM
participant "工人机\n(唯一的作者)" as WORKER
database "MESSAGE_REACTION_FACT" as FACTS
database "MESSAGE\nreactions + reaction_users" as MESSAGE
database "公众活动存储器" as EVENTS
participant "控制器 WebSocket" as DISPATCHER
actor "客户端" as Client

OUTBOX -> PROJECTOR : 事件创建/修改/删除
PROJECTOR -> TASKS : immutable reaction_snapshot(outbox_event_uuid)\nscope=message; 没有 coalescing
TASKS -> WORKER : (project_id, canonical_message_uuid)
WORKER -> CLAIM : 获得独占权 exact key
WORKER -> FACTS : 阅读最新消息
FACTS --> WORKER : 反应的正规集合
group 一个 DB transaction
  WORKER -> MESSAGE : 原子替换两个图片
  WORKER -> EVENTS : durable ready message.updated; unique derivation
end
WORKER -> CLAIM : 释放
EVENTS -> DISPATCHER : 稳定的准备记录
DISPATCHER -> Client : 发送 / 重复 / 播放

note over FACTS,MESSAGE
  事实是真理的来源.
  API 没有执行读循环-变更-记录 JSON-图片.
  API 阅读不聚合事实.
  Topic lock 没有用于 canonical MESSAGE snapshot.
  Lease expiry/fencing, retry/backoff, DLQ/reaper 必须.
end note

@enduml
